			"Message": "style(Wind): Normalize README punctuation and build config indentation\n\nReplace em dashes (—) with hyphens (-) throughout README.md for consistent ASCII punctuation across the documentation. Reformat tsconfig.build.json from 2-space indentation to tab-indented with single-line array items, matching the project's convention established in tsconfig.json.\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely cosmetic formatting normalization across documentation and build configuration.",
			"SHA": "ed1a42e950febefbd3b8d5a429195947fc413bfd"
